{
 "schema": 1,
 "id": "instrument-check",
 "title": {
  "zh": "量具自检：同一族模型的两种求值",
  "en": "Instrument check: one model family evaluated two ways"
 },
 "method": {
  "zh": "MyoLeg 是由 Rajagopal 模型转换来的。这里对右下肢每条肌肉、每个坐标，比较“由 .osim 路径点近似算出的平均力臂”和“MuJoCo 对 MyoLeg 求出的平均力臂”。差别来自三处：我们对 OpenSim 缠绕的近似、MyoLeg 转换时的手工改动（它的说明里列了去掉和改换的缠绕面）、以及膝关节耦合的多项式近似。它给出“量具”本身的误差量级。",
  "en": "MyoLeg was converted from the Rajagopal model. For every right-leg muscle and coordinate this compares the mean moment arm computed approximately from the .osim path points with the one MuJoCo gives for MyoLeg. The differences have three origins: our approximation of OpenSim wrapping, the manual changes made in the MyoLeg conversion (its README lists the wrap surfaces removed or replaced), and the polynomial approximation of the knee coupling. It gives the size of the instrument's own error."
 },
 "tolerance": {
  "zh": "不作判定；用来读其余各表。",
  "en": "No verdict; it is for reading the other tables."
 },
